{"meta":{"id":"ajax-json","category":"it/syntax/jquery/ajax","title":"JSON 응답 받기 · jQuery","subtitle":"(JQUERY · AJAX)","summary":"JSON.parse 로 객체 · 배열 응답 처리, for…of 로 목록 그리기","tags":["jquery","f-network","json"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>JQUERY · AJAX</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">JSON 응답 받기 · jQuery</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> JSON.parse 로 객체 · 배열 응답 처리, for…of 로 목록 그리기</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">JSON 객체 받기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">success: function (res) {\r\n  let js = JSON.parse(res);        // 문자열 → 객체 (dataType: &quot;json&quot; 이면 자동)\r\n  $(&quot;#mid&quot;).html(js.mid);\r\n  $(&quot;#name&quot;).html(js.name);\r\n}</pre></div><div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">JSON 배열 받기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">success: function (res) {\r\n  let list = JSON.parse(res);      // [{...}, {...}]\r\n  let html = &quot;&quot;;\r\n  for (let vo of list) {\r\n    html += `&lt;li&gt;${vo.mid} - ${vo.name}&lt;/li&gt;`;\r\n  }\r\n  $(&quot;#list&quot;).html(html);\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › JSON 응답 (HashMap → JSON), TypeScript › fetch 와 응답 타입</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jquery/ajax/ajax-json","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jquery","title":"JQUERY · AJAX","path":"it/syntax/jquery"},{"id":"ajax","title":"ajax 통신","path":"it/syntax/jquery/ajax"}],"hasImage":false}